menu "Arctic Controller"

    config TEST_ENDPOINTS
        bool "Enable test instrumentation endpoints (/api/test/*)"
        default y
        help
            Enables REST API endpoints for UI testing:
            - GET /api/test/ui-state  (read LVGL widget tree)
            - POST /api/test/click    (click widget by label text)
            These endpoints are intended for automated testing only
            and should be disabled in production builds.

    config ARCTIC_TUYA_LISTEN
        bool "Passive Tuya bus listen mode (RX-only, no bus TX)"
        default y
        help
            Bench/validation mode. Instead of starting the Modbus RTU master,
            the controller splices onto the existing controller<->heat pump
            RS485 bus in RECEIVE-ONLY mode and decodes the Tuya MCU framing
            (55 AA ...) using tuya_codec. The RS485 direction pin is held low
            and the UART TX line is left unrouted, so the Tab5 never transmits
            and is electrically invisible on the bus. Safe to run alongside the
            real controller. Wire settings: 4800 baud 8-E-1.

endmenu
